    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm looking for some advice on how to use ai to optimize my workforce and reduce overhead costs without causing too much employee turnover. what's the best way to go about this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Focus on using AI to automate repetitive, low-value tasks rather than replacing entire roles. This frees up your current staff to focus on more strategic, engaging work, which can improve satisfaction. Implement AI tools incrementally, showcasing them as assistants to boost productivity, not as replacements, which helps ease adoption and reduces anxiety. Transparent communication about how AI will augment, not eliminate, roles is key to minimizing turnover.",
